            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Nuong Han Quoc K-BBQ",
            "review_text": "Mike B\n5 contributions\n0\nUnbelievably Horrible Service!\nFeb 2019 • Solo\nTo start with the menu is not in English, only the prices are in English on certain menus so you don't know what you are getting. I ordered a main dish and then told the waiter i wanted rice as a side dish. The waiter pointed to the rice section on the menu and i ordered a side dish. I also ordered kim chi. Turned out they give everyone kim chi for free with the meal so i ordered it for nothing. The waitress brought the meat and set it in front of me without saying anything. I was about to eat it and realized it was raw. Luckily i didn't eat any of it. Then some one brought hot coals and the waitress came and put the meat on the coals. She then tended to something else at a nearby table. By the time she got back to check the meat it was already charred. At this point I was already finished since the side dish i ordered was not actually rice but a main course with some kind of seafood. The waitress just took the meat off the grill and said sorry. Then they took the coals away without saying anything and I was just sitting there waiting for a long time. When someone finally showed up I told them that if they just didn't charge me for the burnt meat it would be fine. The waitress went to adjust the check then came back and tried to tell me they could bring more neat. Again I told her i just wanted to to leave and did not want to pay for burnt meat. Finally she adusted the check but did not adust the extra 15 percent gratuity. I had had it at this point so I just paid it and left. Needless to say say I will not be going back to give my patronage to this restaurant!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 9, 2019",
